sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant HTTP as HTTP API<br/>:8080
    participant gRPC as IndexerService<br/>:50051 gRPC
    participant Indexer as KV Cache Indexer
    participant TokenDB as ChunkedTokenDatabase
    participant Redis as Redis / Valkey
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry<br/>Collector
    participant PodRecon as PodReconciler
    participant SubMgr as SubscriberManager
    participant vLLM as vLLM Engine Pods
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>:6443

    Note over PodRecon,K8sAPI: Pod Discovery Flow (continuous)
    PodRecon->>K8sAPI: Watch Pods (label selector)<br/>HTTPS/WSS, TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>PodRecon: Pod events (Add/Update/Delete)
    PodRecon->>SubMgr: Add/Remove ZMQ subscription<br/>for discovered pod

    Note over vLLM,Redis: KV Cache Event Ingestion (continuous)
    vLLM->>SubMgr: Publish KV cache events<br/>ZMQ pub/sub, topic "kv@"
    SubMgr->>Indexer: Forward KV cache events<br/>(4 concurrent workers)
    Indexer->>Redis: Store KV block metadata<br/>TCP

    Note over Client,OTel: HTTP Scoring Request
    Client->>HTTP: POST /score_completions<br/>JSON body
    HTTP->>Indexer: Score request
    Indexer->>TokenDB: Tokenize input prompt
    TokenDB-->>Indexer: Token sequence
    Indexer->>Redis: Query KV block index<br/>Compute prefix overlap
    Redis-->>Indexer: Cached block metadata
    Indexer-->>HTTP: Per-pod scores
    HTTP-->>Client: JSON response

    Note over Client,OTel: gRPC Scoring Request
    Client->>gRPC: GetPodScores RPC
    gRPC->>OTel: Export trace span<br/>OTLP/gRPC
    gRPC->>Indexer: Score request
    Indexer->>TokenDB: Tokenize input prompt
    TokenDB-->>Indexer: Token sequence
    Indexer->>Redis: Query KV block index
    Redis-->>Indexer: Cached block metadata
    Indexer-->>gRPC: Per-pod scores
    gRPC-->>Client: GetPodScoresResponse
